<import src="../../utils/banner.wxml"/>
<view class="page"><view class="title">确认订单</view><template is="banner" data="{{error: error}}"/><view class="card"><view class="actions"><button class="{{method==='pickup'?'primary':''}}" data-method="pickup" bindtap="method" disabled="{{submitting||pendingSubmission}}">到店自提</button><button class="{{method==='delivery'?'primary':''}}" data-method="delivery" bindtap="method" disabled="{{submitting||pendingSubmission}}">门店配送</button></view><view wx:if="{{method==='delivery'}}"><picker range="{{addresses}}" range-key="address" value="{{addressIndex}}" bindchange="address" disabled="{{submitting||pendingSubmission}}"><view class="select">{{addresses[addressIndex].address||'请选择地址'}}</view></picker><button class="small" bindtap="addresses" disabled="{{submitting||pendingSubmission}}">管理地址</button></view><view wx:else class="sub">{{store.name}} · 到店自提不收配送费<view>{{store.address}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{store.delivery_rules}}" class="foot">配送 {{store.delivery_rules.start}}–{{store.delivery_rules.end}}{{store.delivery_rules.provisional_hours?'（暂定）':''}}。5千克内按基础运费，超出每千克加1.5元；{{store.delivery_rules.rounding==='proportional'?'超出部分按实际重量比例计费':'不足1千克按1千克计费'}}{{store.delivery_rules.provisional_rounding?'（零头规则待确认）':''}}。满额免基础运费，超重费另计；散装零食、槟榔仅限自提。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section">优惠券（每单限1张，不叠加）</view><picker range="{{coupons}}" range-key="title" value="{{couponIndex}}" bindchange="coupon" disabled="{{submitting||pendingSubmission}}"><view class="select">{{coupons[couponIndex].title}}</view></picker><view wx:if="{{quote}}"><view class="line" wx:for="{{quote.items}}" wx:key="sku_id"><image src="{{item.imageURL}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view>{{item.name}} ×{{item.quantity}}<view class="sub" wx:if="{{item.pickup_only}}">仅限自提</view></view></view><view class="row spread bill"><text>商品金额</text><text>¥{{quote.subtotal}}</text></view><view class="row spread bill"><text>优惠抵扣</text><text>−¥{{quote.discount}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{method==='delivery'&&quote.shipping_detail.rules}}"><view class="row spread bill"><text>配送总重量</text><text>{{quote.weight}}</text></view><view class="row spread bill"><text>基础配送费</text><text>¥{{quote.baseShipping}}</text></view><view class="row spread bill"><text>超重附加费</text><text>¥{{quote.extraShipping}}</text></view></view><view class="row spread bill"><text>配送费合计</text><text>¥{{quote.shipping}}</text></view><view class="row spread bill"><text>应付合计</text><text class="price">¥{{quote.total}}</text></view></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{pendingSubmission}}">上次提交结果尚未确认。点击“重试原订单”确认同一次提交。退出或重启后，可从“订单记录”继续处理；不要重复下单。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{(!quote&&!pendingSubmission)||submitting}}">{{pendingSubmission?'重试原订单':'提交订单'}}</button><button class="small plain" wx:if="{{pendingSubmission}}" bindtap="orders" disabled="{{submitting}}">查看订单记录</button><button class="small plain" wx:if="{{!pendingSubmission}}" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{submitting}}">重新获取报价</button><view class="foot">所有金额由服务端计算。报价2分钟有效；提交后库存预占15分钟。</view></view></view>
